    "\\b(i|we) (just |finally |have |'ve )?(built|made|shipped|launched|vibe[- ]?coded|deployed|released|hacked together|threw together)\\b",
    "\\bbuilt (it|this|a|an)\\b",
    "\\b(is|now) live\\b",
